WEBVTT

00:01:58.614 --> 00:02:01.075
It's called a "calling-in culture."

00:02:02.285 --> 00:02:04.912
Now, some people really do believe

00:02:04.954 --> 00:02:08.583
that the only way to do human rights work
is the way they want --

00:02:08.624 --> 00:02:10.877
you know, my way or the highway.

00:02:11.627 --> 00:02:17.967
But the problem is, when many different
people think many different thoughts

00:02:18.009 --> 00:02:20.386
and they move in the same direction,

00:02:20.386 --> 00:02:21.929
that's a movement.

00:02:22.972 --> 00:02:27.226
But when many different people
think one thought,

00:02:27.226 --> 00:02:29.812
and they move in the same direction,

00:02:29.854 --> 00:02:31.522
that's a cult.